cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article and this software archive."
title: "1DSink Along-Trench Morphometric Framework"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB pipeline for one-dimensional along-trench morphometric decomposition
  and sediment-trapping (Trapping Index) analysis of the Kuril-Kamchatka Trench,
  validated against surface-sediment geochemistry.
type: software
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
